                        <additions>
                            <list>
                                <item xml:id="a1">
                                    <desc type="ScribalNoteCompleting">Note possibly by the author
                                        (<persName role="author" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15077TaklaWM">fitāwrāri Takla Walda Māryām</persName>, being introduced here with
                                        fitawrār Taḵla Waldamāryām), stating the title of the work in <ref target="#p1_i1"/> and 
                                        <ref target="#p2_i1"/>, as well as the name of their author. It is placed on an endleaf, which is presumably bound at front of the
                                        codex.</desc>
                                    <q xml:lang="ti">ኑዛዜን፡ ምጽያፍን፡ ናይ፡ ፊተውራር፡ 
                                        <persName role="author" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15077TaklaWM">ተኽለ፡ ወልደማርያም፡</persName> ዓዲ፡ ዛርና፡ ሰራየ።</q>
                                </item>
                                <item xml:id="a2">
                                    <desc type="Comment">Note by <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3182ContiRo">Carlo Conti Rossini</persName> on the death of fitawrāri Takla Walda Māryām
                                        (the author of the work in <ref target="p1_i1"/>/<ref target="p2_i1"/>) in 1941 AD, explaining, that he held the 
                                        title of a Šum Bāšā. It is placed on an endleaf, which is presumably bound in front of the codex, directly below
                                        <ref target="#a1"/>.</desc>
                                    <q xml:lang="it">L’autore morì verso il 
                                        <choice resp="PRS8999Strelcyn"><sic>19401</sic><corr>1941</corr></choice>. Era uno scium-bascià.</q>
                                </item>
                                <item xml:id="a3">
                                    <locus from="8r"/>
                                    <desc type="OwnershipNote">Name of the person (<persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15078BakweraDen">Bakʷǝra Dǝngǝl</persName>), for whom 
                                        <ref target="p1_i2"/>/<ref target="p2_i2"/> (Miracles of Mary) have been copied.
                                        It is not clear from the description in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/N6HPGQK3"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/><title level="m">Catalogue des manuscrits éthiopiens de l’Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei: Fonds Conti Rossini et Fonds Caetani 209, 375, 376, 377, 378</title><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><author><forename>Stefan</forename><surname>Strelcyn</surname></author><pubPlace>Roma</pubPlace><publisher>Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei</publisher><date>1976</date><series><title level="s">Indici e Sussidi Bibliografici della Biblioteca</title><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope></series><biblScope unit="volume">9</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:IHABook182</note><note type="tag">bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue</note><citedRange unit="page">200</citedRange></bibl>, whether this information is given in an additional note
                                        or is included in the text.</desc>
                                </item>
                            </list>
